{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":38,"scene_status":"corrected-source-reconciled","unit_count":15,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u001","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Pandiyan walks in confusion; only his voice is heard over his face.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u002","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d001","speaker_label":"குரல்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"On the wedding day, one woman deceived me. Two women are competing for love. The bedchamber of an old man who walks leaning on a staff is becoming a sacrificial rock for a woman. A women's world filled with both comedy and pain!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u003","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Pandiyan meets Poomalai. He stops with a start.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d002","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Poomalai!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d003","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Choked with emotion) Forgive me!...I disturbed your mind."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d004","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"You are the one who must forgive me! I was the cause of the dark spot called love appearing in your pure white heart!..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d005","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Love is not a dark spot. Are unreachable grapes sour, Pandiyan? (In pain) Kumudha is the one who captured your heart! Accept her!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d006","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":41}]},"translation":{"english_text":"My life is an arena of contests! An earthquake! Gardens like Kumudha should not be caught in it and ruined!...."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d007","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"It is no longer an arena of contests. Poomalai has admitted defeat. So it is no earthquake either; it is a breeze carrying a new fragrance—Kumudha is calling you, and so...."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u010","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d008","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Sadly) Poomalai...."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u011","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d009","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(With sorrowful resolve) Pandiyan, I have sacrificed my love—for my Kumudha!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u012","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d010","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Are you alone entitled to sacrifice love? I have that right too."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u013","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d011","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"No—accept my Kumudha! Don't deceive her! She does not have the strength to carry sorrow! I plead with you. Forget my mistakes! Come home!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u014","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d012","speaker_label":"பாண்டியன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Poomalai...."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s038-u015","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s038-d013","speaker_label":"பூமாலை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":42}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I'm inviting you happily! Wipe the tears of my precious Kumudha! It is enough for me if she lives! Come...."}}]}